识别并替换图标库、图片占位符或其他逻辑节点。","图层剥离","静默且安全地删除单一或多选的冗余图层，保持画布极简。","多维差异对比","构建视觉高亮。实时比对线上画布状态与本地构建基准之间的差异。","代码逆向覆盖","形成完美闭环。将全量代码结构，直接投射覆盖至设计稿。","资产快照流转","利用唯一 Id，在研发团队内部无缝提取并分享设计资产片段。","Phase 3 / Conversational UI","语言即是接口","User Command","创建页面 · Generate","Agent is generating UI...","使用组件库 · Design System","使用 MasterGo MCP，用当前文件已订阅的团队组件库生成 CRM 客户管理页面。","Connecting to Design System...","创建组件 · Component","使用 MasterGo MCP，为我生成一套按钮组件，要求有大中小尺寸和不同的状态。","Creating atom variants...","读取上下文 · Context Read","Scanning selection...","局部修改 · Update","使用 MasterGo MCP，把当前选中按钮背景改成黑色，文字改成白色。","Applying local styles...","同步覆盖 · Sync","Syncing with codebase..."],"rootMetadata":{"width":1440,"height":3923,"name":"MasterGo MCP 介绍文档","type":"FRAME","fill":"paint_755:01780","styles":{"paint_755:01780":{"value":["#FCFCFD"]},"paint_755:01786":{"value":["rgba(219, 234, 254, 0.4)"]},"paint_755:01802":{"value":["#111827"]},"paint_755:01811":{"value":["#000000"]},"paint_755:01815":{"value":["#FFFFFF"]},"paint_755:01980":{"value":["#6B7280"]},"paint_103:03288":{"value":["#FFFFFF"]},"paint_755:02011":{"value":["#10B981"]},"paint_755:02045":{"value":["#374151"]},"paint_755:02001":{"value":["#000000"]},"paint_755:02111":{"value":["linear-gradient(90deg, #2563EB 0%, #8B5CF6 100%)"]},"paint_755:02202":{"value":["#E5E7EB"]},"paint_755:02210":{"value":["#D1D5DB"]},"paint_755:02244":{"value":["#2563EB"]},"paint_755:02322":{"value":["linear-gradient(180deg, #DBEAFE 0%, #BFDBFE 100%)"]},"paint_755:02353":{"value":["#1E40AF"]},"paint_755:02489":{"value":["linear-gradient(180deg, #EDE9FE 0%, #DDD6FE 100%)"]},"paint_755:02519":{"value":["#7C3AED"]},"paint_755:02624":{"value":["linear-gradient(180deg, #D1FAE5 0%, #A7F3D0 100%)"]},"paint_755:02654":{"value":["#059669"]},"paint_755:02768":{"value":["#101827"]},"paint_755:02782":{"value":["#FF7A59"]},"paint_755:02793":{"value":["#F6C453"]},"paint_755:02799":{"value":["#58D68D"]},"paint_755:02831":{"value":["#9CA3AF"]},"paint_755:02860":{"value":["#B1C1E2"]},"paint_